      <span class="mw-empty-elt"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1364180890" about="#mwt5" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Message box/ambox.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'/></span><table class="box-Original_research plainlinks metadata ambox ambox-content ambox-Original_research" role="presentation"><tbody><tr><td class="mbox-image"><div class="mbox-image-div"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Ambox_important.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/b/b4/Ambox_important.svg/40px-Ambox_important.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/b/b4/Ambox_important.svg/120px-Ambox_important.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="" data-file-width="40" data-file-height="40" data-file-type="drawing" height="40" width="40" class="mw-file-element"/></span></span></div></td><td class="mbox-text"><div class="mbox-text-span">This article <b>may contain <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:No_original_research" title="Wikipedia:No original research">original research</a></b>.<span class="hide-when-compact"> Please <a rel="mw:ExtLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Comparison_of_web_browsers&amp;action=edit" class="external text" data-mw-original-href="//en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Comparison_of_web_browsers&amp;action=edit">improve it</a> by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Verifiability" title="Wikipedia:Verifiability">verifying</a> the claims made and adding <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Citing_sources#Inline_citations" title="Wikipedia:Citing sources">inline citations</a>. Statements consisting only of original research should